<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 02:09:02 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>3支90后另类摇滚乐队重聚，温暖我千禧一代的心</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-alt-rock-bands-from-the-90s-who-have-reunited-warming-my-millennial-heart/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;重聚的感觉真好，看着这些90年代的摇滚乐队近年来强势回归，我的千禧一代心里暖暖的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-alt-rock-bands-from-the-90s-who-have-reunited-warming-my-millennial-heart/"&gt;3支90后另类摇滚乐队重聚，温暖我千禧一代的心，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:36:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-alt-rock-bands-from-the-90s-who-have-reunited-warming-my-millennial-heart/</guid></item><item><title>朋克传奇人物组建超级团体，在伦敦音乐节上举办仅限一晚的演出，庆祝女性朋克 50 周年</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/punk-legends-forming-supergroup-for-one-night-only-gig-at-london-festival-celebrating-50-years-of-women-in-punk/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一场庆祝朋克摇滚女性先锋 50 周年的节日正在将几位标志性人物重新聚集在一起，组成一个独一无二的超级乐队。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/punk-legends-forming-supergroup-for-one-night-only-gig-at-london-festival-celebrating-50-years-of-women-in-punk/"&gt;朋克传奇在伦敦庆祝朋克女性 50 周年音乐节上组建超级团体进行一晚演出，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:30:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/punk-legends-forming-supergroup-for-one-night-only-gig-at-london-festival-celebrating-50-years-of-women-in-punk/</guid></item><item><title>Coi Leray 详述了她与 Latto 的闹翻：“幕后发生的事情太过分了”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/coi-leray-details-her-fallout-with-latto-something-happened-behind-the-scenes-that-went-too-far/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;科伊·利里 (Coi Leary) 公开了她与拉托 (Latto) 之间的矛盾，透露她在一些酒吧与这位“大妈妈”说唱歌手的妹妹发生了争执。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/coi-leray-details-her-fallout-with-latto-something-happened-behind-the-scenes-that-went-too-far/"&gt;Coi Leray 详细介绍了她与 Latto 的闹翻：“幕后发生的事情太过分了”&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:28:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/coi-leray-details-her-fallout-with-latto-something-happened-behind-the-scenes-that-went-too-far/</guid></item><item><title>开创 2000 年代后英式流行音乐的 3 支乐队</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-bands-who-pioneered-2000s-post-britpop/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;英伦流行音乐在 20 世纪 90 年代中期达到顶峰，这三支后英伦流行乐队继续将火炬传递到 2000 年代。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;开创&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-bands-who-pioneered-2000s-post-britpop/"&gt;2000 年代后英式流行音乐的 3 支乐队&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:52:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-bands-who-pioneered-2000s-post-britpop/</guid></item><item><title>说唱明星在提出了几周的想法后，发布了艾拉·兰利 (Ella Langley) 的《Choosin&amp;#39; Texas》的奇异混音版</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/rap-star-releases-bizarre-remix-of-ella-langleys-choosin-texas-after-weeks-of-floating-the-idea/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德雷克终于发布了他期待已久的与唐·托利弗 (Don Toliver) 合作的艾拉·兰利 (Ella Langley) 的《选择德克萨斯》(Choosin&amp;#39; Texas) 混音版，我有点不知所措。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/rap-star-releases-bizarre-remix-of-ella-langleys-choosin-texas-after-weeks-of-floating-the-idea/"&gt;说唱明星在漂浮了几周的想法后发布了艾拉兰利的“选择德克萨斯”的奇异混音，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:48:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/rap-star-releases-bizarre-remix-of-ella-langleys-choosin-texas-after-weeks-of-floating-the-idea/</guid></item><item><title>奥兹·奥斯本的最后一场音乐会终于在万圣节前夕在剧院进行限量放映</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/ozzy-osbournes-final-concert-is-finally-coming-to-theaters-for-a-limited-run-just-before-halloween/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;黑色安息日的最后一场音乐会“回到起点”音乐节是为万圣节周末上映的音乐会电影拍摄的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/ozzy-osbournes-final-concert-is-finally-coming-to-theaters-for-a-limited-run-just-before-halloween/"&gt;奥兹·奥斯本 (Ozzy Osbourne) 的最后一场音乐会终于在万圣节前夕在剧院进行有限放映，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:42:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/ozzy-osbournes-final-concert-is-finally-coming-to-theaters-for-a-limited-run-just-before-halloween/</guid></item><item><title>有史以来最被低估的 3 首 Metro Boomin 节拍</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-underrated-metro-boomin-beats-of-all-time/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;为了纪念 Metro Boomin 今天 33 岁了，我们在他的目录中选择了三首最被低估的节拍。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-underrated-metro-boomin-beats-of-all-time/"&gt;有史以来最被低估的 Metro Boomin Beats 的第 3 首&lt;/a&gt;歌曲首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-of-the-most-underrated-metro-boomin-beats-of-all-time/</guid></item><item><title>3 首 20 世纪 90 年代的歌曲让我对宅在家里感觉更好</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-songs-from-the-1990s-that-make-me-feel-better-about-being-a-homebody/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Noisey 为每一位宁愿宅在家里也不愿出去参加派对的宅男和内向者挑选了三首 90 年代的经典歌曲。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-songs-from-the-1990s-that-make-me-feel-better-about-being-a-homebody/"&gt;3 Songs From the 90s That Make Me Feel Better About Being a Homebody&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:35:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-songs-from-the-1990s-that-make-me-feel-better-about-being-a-homebody/</guid></item><item><title>《周末》透露了他“着迷”的一张前专辑以及他计划如何修复它</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-weeknd-reveals-the-one-former-album-hes-obsessing-over-and-how-he-plans-to-fix-it/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;The Weeknd 取笑了他的唱片中的一张专辑的重新制作，似乎只有铁杆粉丝才会真正喜欢和欣赏。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-weeknd-reveals-the-one-former-album-hes-obsessing-over-and-how-he-plans-to-fix-it/"&gt;《The Weeknd》的帖子揭露了他“着迷”的一张前专辑以及他计划如何修复它，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/the-weeknd-reveals-the-one-former-album-hes-obsessing-over-and-how-he-plans-to-fix-it/</guid></item><item><title>2010 年代合成流行音乐偶像揭示了她十年之久从聚光灯下消失的原因</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/2010s-synthpop-icon-reveals-the-reason-for-her-decade-long-disappearance-from-the-spotlight/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;La Roux 于 2009 年凭借《Bulletproof》取得了突破，但音乐界让 Elly Jackson 从聚光灯下退出了十年。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这位&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/2010s-synthpop-icon-reveals-the-reason-for-her-decade-long-disappearance-from-the-spotlight/"&gt;2010 年代后合成流行音乐偶像揭示了她十年之久从聚光灯下消失的原因，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:18:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/2010s-synthpop-icon-reveals-the-reason-for-her-decade-long-disappearance-from-the-spotlight/</guid></item></channel></rss>